      "name": "Critical infrastructure orgs face heightened cyber risk from nation-state groups, AI threats",
      "description": "Critical infrastructure faces mounting threats from nation-state groups and AI-driven attacks. Always a prime target for cybercriminals, hacktivists, and nation-state hacking groups, critical infrastructure organizations this year have been grappling with a heightened threat from adversaries affiliated with Iran\u2019s government, as documented by global cybersecurity agencies and researchers. Specifically, many of these nation-state groups have shifted their focus from stealthy cyber espionage activities to destructive cyber attacks designed to disrupt victims\u2019 operations, experts have observed.",
